SUMMARY:Solo Ono Album Release Show (Uhrzeit prüfen)
LOCATION:Rhiz
DESCRIPTION:PALOMA 004 (Vienna\, AT) Stilistisch bewegt sich Paloma 004 zwischen Post Punk\, Grunge\, Shoegaze und Synthpop - mit deutschen Texten\, die Alltagsabsurditäten und tiefere Sinnfragen verhandeln. Datum: 19.09.2026 | Einlass: 17:30 Uhr Beginn: 18:00 | Ende: 20:15 Uhr  Free entry Solo Ono (Graz\, AT) Solo Ono are a New Zealand-born\, Graz-based garage-pop band built on fuzzy guitars\, big hooks and a love of keeping things a little rough around the edges. Formed in Wellington\, the band spent their early years playing sweaty bars\, DIY venues and festivals around New Zealand\, sharing stages with the likes of The Chills\, She's So Rad and Terror of the Deep. Now reassembled in Austria with a new line-up\, Solo Ono are making noise again — louder and fuzzier and with a new album on the way. Their show at Rhiz coincides with the release of the first single from the forthcoming album\, the first glimpse of what's coming next. https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Zc170Owym0c&list=RDZc170Owym0c&start_radio=1
URL:https://rhiz.wien/copilotevent/19-09-2026_solo-ono-album-release-show
END:VEVENT
